source_id":"s-sanguozhi-009-caozhen"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-009-caozhen:p010","text":"爽弟羲為中領軍訓武衞將軍彦散騎常侍侍講其餘諸弟皆以列侯侍從出入禁闥貴寵莫盛焉南陽何晏鄧颺李勝沛國丁謐東平畢軌咸有聲名進趨於時明帝以其浮華皆抑黜之及爽秉政乃復進叙任為腹心颺等欲令爽立威名於天下勸使伐蜀爽從其言宣王止之不能禁正始五年爽乃西至長安大發卒六七萬人從駱谷入是時闗中及氐羌轉輸不能供牛馬騾驢多死民夷號泣道路入谷行數百里賊因山為固兵不得進爽參軍楊偉為爽陳形勢宜急還不然將敗","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-009-caozhen:p010:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"爽","kind":"person","person_id":"30k_jzz_tpd_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"完整曹真曹爽敘事與本段引文語境辨識；AI判讀，未圖校。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-009-caozhen:p010:m0002","start":2,"end":3,"surface":"羲","kind":"person","person_id":"30k_jzz_tpd_AB","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"完整曹真曹爽敘事與本段引文語境辨識；AI判讀，未圖校。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-009-caozhen:p010:m0007","start":7,"end":8,"surface":"訓","kind":"person","person_id":"30k_jzz_tpd_AC","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"逐句核讀此明示人物／匿名親屬；只在指定語境辨識，未核影像。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-009-caozhen:p010:m0012","start":12,"end":13,"surface":"彦","kind":"person","person_id":"30k_jzz_tpd_AE","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"完整曹真曹爽敘事與本段引文語境辨識；AI判讀，未圖校。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-009-caozhen:p010:m0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"何晏","kind":"person","person_id":"0db_22c_332_*A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"完整曹真曹爽敘事與本段引文語境辨識；AI判讀，未圖校。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-009-caozhen:p010:m0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"鄧颺","kind":"person","person_id":"o5w_eyp_jhb","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"完整曹真曹爽敘事與本段引文語境辨識；AI判讀，未圖校。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-009-caozhen:p010:m0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"李勝","kind":"person","person_id":"rnj_yeg_1ii","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"完整曹真曹爽敘事與本段引文語境辨識；AI判讀，未圖校。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-009-caozhen:p010:m0048","start":48,"end":50,"surface":"丁謐","kind":"person","person_id":"0yu_ze0_8wq","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"完整曹真曹爽敘事與本段引文語境辨識；AI判讀，未圖校。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-009-caozhen:p010:m0052","start":52